AI-POWERED FEATURES DISCLAIMER

THIS SOFTWARE INCLUDES OPTIONAL ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE FEATURES THAT USE LARGE
LANGUAGE MODELS (LLMs) TO GENERATE FILE ORGANIZATION, CATEGORIZATION, AND
RENAMING SUGGESTIONS. THESE SUGGESTIONS ARE PRODUCED BY MACHINE LEARNING MODELS
AND MAY BE INACCURATE, INCOMPLETE, OR INAPPROPRIATE. THE LICENSOR MAKES NO
REPRESENTATIONS OR WARRANTIES REGARDING THE ACCURACY, RELIABILITY, OR
COMPLETENESS OF ANY AI-GENERATED SUGGESTIONS.

YOU ARE SOLELY RESPONSIBLE FOR REVIEWING AND APPROVING ALL AI-GENERATED
SUGGESTIONS BEFORE THEY ARE EXECUTED. THE LICENSOR SHALL NOT BE LIABLE FOR ANY
DATA LOSS, DATA CORRUPTION, FILE MISPLACEMENT, INCORRECT RENAMING, OR OTHER HARM
RESULTING FROM THE EXECUTION OF AI-GENERATED SUGGESTIONS, WHETHER OR NOT YOU
REVIEWED SUCH SUGGESTIONS PRIOR TO EXECUTION.

DRIVESYNCAI DOES NOT USE YOUR FILE DATA TO TRAIN AI MODELS. AI FEATURES ANALYZE
FILE METADATA (SUCH AS FILE NAMES, PATHS, SIZES, TYPES, AND DOCUMENT PROPERTIES)
TO GENERATE SUGGESTIONS. ACTUAL FILE CONTENTS ARE NOT READ, ANALYZED, OR
TRANSMITTED FOR AI PROCESSING.

THIRD-PARTY SERVICE DISCLOSURE

WHEN CONFIGURED TO USE CLOUD-BASED LLM PROVIDERS (INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO
OPENAI, ANTHROPIC, GOOGLE, AND PERPLEXITY), THIS SOFTWARE TRANSMITS FILE METADATA
(INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO FILE NAMES, FILE PATHS, FILE SIZES, FILE TYPES,
DOCUMENT METADATA, AND EXIF DATA) TO THIRD-PARTY SERVERS OPERATED BY THOSE
PROVIDERS. ACTUAL FILE CONTENTS ARE NOT TRANSMITTED. WHEN CONFIGURED TO USE LOCAL
PROVIDERS (SUCH AS OLLAMA), ALL PROCESSING OCCURS ENTIRELY ON YOUR DEVICE AND NO
DATA IS TRANSMITTED TO EXTERNAL SERVICES.

YOUR USE OF THIRD-PARTY LLM SERVICES IS SUBJECT TO THE TERMS OF SERVICE AND
PRIVACY POLICIES OF THOSE RESPECTIVE PROVIDERS. THE LICENSOR IS NOT RESPONSIBLE
FOR THE DATA HANDLING PRACTICES OF THIRD-PARTY SERVICE PROVIDERS. YOU ARE SOLELY
RESPONSIBLE FOR ENSURING YOUR USE OF SUCH SERVICES COMPLIES WITH APPLICABLE LAWS
AND REGULATIONS, INCLUDING DATA PROTECTION AND PRIVACY LAWS.
